<title>NEW ZEALAND: RBNZ to offer NZ$100 mln of govt bonds in tend.</title>
<headline>RBNZ to offer NZ$100 mln of govt bonds in tend.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of New Zealand said on Thursday it would offer NZ$100 million of February 2001 government bonds at its next tender on December 12.</p>
<p>The bonds have an 8.00 percent coupon.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
